        72.91801452636719,
        389.43939208984375,
        554.0430297851562,
        401.39459228515625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91801452636719,
        398.7679748535156
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "소산력은 계의 전체 에너지를 바꾸지 않으며, 전체 에너지는"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b10:l2:s0-2",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        10,
        2,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "can only be changed by the work done by the external force. The temperature of the system is",
      "rect": [
        72.91801452636719,
        400.9933776855469,
        554.0430908203125,
        412.9485778808594
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91801452636719,
        410.32196044921875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "외력이 하는 일에 의해서만 변한다고 가정한다. 계의 온도는"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b10:l3:s0-26",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        10,
        3,
        0,
        26
      ],
      "source": "positive. The heat conduction within the body is fast enough for the temperature distribution",
      "rect": [
        72.91801452636719,
        412.54736328125,
        554.0669555664062,
        424.5025634765625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91801452636719,
        421.8759460449219
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "양수이다. 내부 열전도는 온도가 균일하다고 볼 만큼"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b10:l4:s0-28",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        10,
        4,
        0,
        28
      ],
      "source": "to be considered homogeneous, while the heat capacity is large enough for the temperature to",
      "rect": [
        72.91801452636719,
        424.1013488769531,
        554.0670166015625,
        436.0565490722656
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91801452636719,
        433.429931640625
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "빠르고, 열용량은 과정 중 온도가 거의"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b10:l5:s0-10",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        10,
        5,
        0,
        10
      ],
      "source": "not change significantly during the process.",
      "rect": [
        72.91801452636719,
        435.65533447265625,
        294.9141540527344,
        447.61053466796875
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91801452636719,
        444.9839172363281
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "변하지 않을 만큼 크다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b10:l6:s0-30",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        10,
        6,
        0,
        30
      ],
      "source": "Our question: If the entropy of the system can not decrease, then what inequality can be",
      "rect": [
        72.91801452636719,
        452.19134521484375,
        554.0191650390625,
        464.14654541015625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91801452636719,
        461.5199279785156
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "계의 엔트로피가 감소할 수 없다면 소산력은 어떤"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b10:l7:s0-14",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        10,
        7,
        0,
        14
      ],
      "source": "written for the dissipative force? Interpret the result.",
      "rect": [
        72.91801452636719,
        463.7453308105469,
        345.93890380859375,
        475.7005310058594
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91801452636719,
        473.07391357421875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "부등식을 만족해야 하는가? 그 의미를 설명하라."
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b11:l0:s0-6",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        11,
        0,
        0,
        6
      ],
      "source": "(Ákos Gombkötő, Péter Ván)",
      "rect": [
        403.4010009765625,
        492.23931884765625,
        553.952880859375,
        504.19451904296875
      ],
      "point": [
        403.4010009765625,
        501.5679016113281
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
