    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l0:s0-26",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        0,
        0,
        26
      ],
      "source": "There is a spherically symmetric atmosphere around a spherical planet. The refractive index",
      "rect": [
        52.110992431640625,
        541.3903198242188,
        554.0499877929688,
        553.3455200195312
      ],
      "point": [
        52.110992431640625,
        550.7188720703125
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "구형 행성 주위에 구대칭 대기가 있다. 대기의 굴절률",
      "char_start": 4,
      "retained_native_prefix": "22. "
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l1:s4-33",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        1,
        4,
        33
      ],
      "source": " of the atmosphere depends only on the distance from the surface of the planet, and",
      "rect": [
        94.61392211914062,
        553.6773681640625,
        554.0208740234375,
        565.632568359375
      ],
      "point": [
        94.61392211914062,
        563.0059204101562
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "는 행성 표면으로부터의 거리에만 의존하며,"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l2:s0-10",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        2,
        0,
        10
      ],
      "source": "monotonously decreases from the surface value",
      "rect": [
        72.9179916381836,
        565.8963623046875,
        320.53411865234375,
        577.8515625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.9179916381836,
        575.2249145507812
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "표면에서의 값"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l2:s15-19",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        2,
        15,
        19
      ],
      "source": "to the value",
      "rect": [
