      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        586.7789306640625
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "진공의 우주 공간을 향해 단조롭게 감소한다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l4:s0-0",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        4,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "An astronaut, standing on the surface, projects a horizontal beam of light from his handheld",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        594.7163696289062,
        554.0908813476562,
        606.6715698242188
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        604.044921875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "지표면의 우주인이 손전등으로 수평 광선을 쏜다.",
      "char_start": 3,
      "retained_native_prefix": "a) "
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l5:s0-2",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        5,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "torchlight (that is, the light beam is initially parallel with the surface). Determine the necessary",
      "rect": [
