        607.6643676757812,
        554.06689453125,
        619.6195678710938
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        616.992919921875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "즉 광선은 처음에 표면과 평행하다. 광선이"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l6:s0-28",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        6,
        0,
        28
      ],
      "source": "conditions allowing the beam of light to reach to the outer space—or alternatively, that the",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        619.8823852539062,
        554.0907592773438,
        631.8375854492188
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        629.2109375
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "우주로 빠져나가거나, 반대로 다시"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l7:s0-32",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        7,
        0,
        32
      ],
      "source": "light would ‘fall’ back on the surface. Disregard effects due to the rotation of the planet, or",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        631.4373168945312,
        554.0669555664062,
        643.3925170898438
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        640.765869140625
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "표면으로 “떨어지는” 데 필요한 조건을 구하라. 행성 자전 및"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l8:s0-14",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        8,
        0,
        14
      ],
      "source": "any attenuation or scattering of the light beam.",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        642.9913330078125,
        317.5692138671875,
        654.946533203125
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        652.3198852539062
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "광선의 감쇠·산란은 무시하라."
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l9:s0-32",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        9,
        0,
        32
      ],
      "source": "A spaceship approaches the planet from infinitely far. Due to the curved light path in the",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        660.25634765625,
        554.0550537109375,
        672.2115478515625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        669.5848999023438
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "우주선이 무한히 먼 곳에서 행성으로 접근한다. 대기 속에서 광선이",
      "char_start": 3,
      "retained_native_prefix": "b) "
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l10:s0-0",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        10,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "atmosphere, the solid body of the planet appears to be larger than it is actually, when observed",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        672.475341796875,
        554.078857421875,
        684.4305419921875
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        681.8038940429688
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "휘므로 우주인에게 고체 행성이 실제보다 크게"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l11:s0-24",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        11,
        0,
        24
      ],
      "source": "by the astronauts. Determine the apparent linear magnification. How this question is related",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        684.0293579101562,
        554.0789184570312,
        695.9845581054688
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        693.35791015625
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "보인다. 겉보기 선형 배율을 구하라. 이 물음은"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l12:s0-6",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        12,
        0,
        6
      ],
      "source": "to the previous one?",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        696.3133544921875,
        177.0478057861328,
        708.2685546875
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        705.6419067382812
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "앞 문항과 어떤 관계가 있는가?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8:b12:l12:s7-20",
      "page": 8,
      "at": [
        12,
        12,
        7,
        20
